<title>SINGAPORE: SIA proposes 7.5 pct bonus dividend.</title>
<headline>SIA proposes 7.5 pct bonus dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Airlines Ltd (SIA) said on Friday it was proposing a bonus dividend of 7.5 percent or 7.5 cents per share less tax to commemorate its 50th anniversary.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
